<p>Please check the set method conflict</p>
<pre><code>//try to @JsonIgnore in set method 
public void setSystemConfig(Config config)   {

}

public void setSystemConfig(Config config,String version)   {

}
</code></pre>
<p>Try using @JsonIgnore annotations to ignore some classes.</p>
<p>It could also be a jar conflict，you can add it in pom.xml</p>
